// DAVOF plane ladder on a POLYHEDRAL mesh (mesh: poly -> cfMesh pMesh,
// 2026-10-12). This file REPLACES planeNormal3DLadder.parameter for mesh: poly
// studies (workflow/Snakefile PARAM_FILE): the exact-solution geometry of
// cases/davof/planeNormal3D (an implicitPlane in the 4 mm box) on the N_CELLS
// ladder 20/40/80/160 that the sphere and ellipsoid tests use; cfMesh is asked
// for maxCellSize = h/2^(-1/3), h = DOMAIN_LENGTH/N_CELLS (the derived token
// CFMESH_CELL_SIZE: the dual cells at the interface measure 2^(-1/3) maxCellSize,
// the pin of workflow/README.md).
// Both surface-based states (detrixheAslam, quadraticFaces) are exact for a
// plane on every polyhedral cell (the fan sums of davofState::mTri), so the
// DAVOF normal, position and curvature must be at round-off at every N; the
// cross-check models show their errors. Serial, seconds per case; cfMesh needs
// jemalloc preloaded on the laptop (LEIA_PMESH_PRELOAD, workflow/README.md).
values
{
    solver (leiaTestDavofNormal);

    N_CELLS ( 20 40 80 160 );

    DOMAIN_LENGTH ( 0.004 );

    SURFACE_FILE ( box4mm-faces.stl );

    DAVOF_ALPHA_SOURCE ( detrixheAslam quadraticFaces );

    DAVOF_CROSS_CHECK ( geometricVoF );

    DAVOF_CURV_MODEL_1 ( normalsOnly );

    DAVOF_CURV_MODEL_2 ( none );
}
